{"articleNo":"47726","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=47726&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012-1학기 대학원 가계곤란장학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.04.10","hit":"6596","attachments":[{"name":"가계곤란학비감면신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=47726&attachNo=2137"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2.55pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 2.55pt double; WIDTH: 411.05pt; BACKGROUND: #ccffff; HEIGHT: 39.8pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2.55pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 2.55pt double\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012-1학기 대학원 가계곤란장학생 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012-1학기 대학원 학비감면에 반영하고자 하오니 아래 조건에 해당되는 대학원생은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 아 래 -</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 신청대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 및 컨설팅대학원 재학생으로 아래 조건에 충족되는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 국민기초생활수급자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 차상위계층 의료수급자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 장애인(1-3급)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 수료자 및 학기초과자 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 2012. 04. 12(목)- 04. 20(금)[09:00~18:00]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제 출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">처</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 해당학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">기초생활수급자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 기초생활수급자증명서(주민센터</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">의 확인서류)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">차상위계층 의료수급자 : 차상위증명서(국민건강보험공단의 확인서류) 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 장애인(1-3급) : 장애인복지카드 및 장애인증명서 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 공통서류 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 가계곤란 학비감면 신청서(서식) 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 주민등록등본 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 신청서류는 1개월이내 발급한 것이어야 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 기타사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">대학원 가계곤란장학생 신청과 관련한 자세한 문의사항은 본교 대학원지원팀(☏478-7015)으로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 04. 12.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso